 268, a thixotropic, quick-curing unsaturated polyester resin suitable as a general-purpose resin; polyester resin 9509, a general-purpose material used in the production of marine boats and water slides; and polyester resin 2802, which is used as a component in the pultrusion process. The company's products are used in producing various finished goods, such as handrails, bench tops, and automotive and aero parts; paneling for hospital, laboratory, and industrial clean rooms; and covers for various instruments used in manufacturing. It develops and provides non-invasive liquid biopsy tests for the early detection of biomarkers. BioNexus Gene Lab Corp. was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia."}}